{"id":"triomphe","lemma":"triomphe","pos":"noun","rank":4445,"glosses":["triumph"],"ipa":"/tʁi.jɔ̃f/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/62/Fr-triomphe.ogg/Fr-triomphe.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"triomphes"},"formAudio":{"triomphes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fd/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-triomphes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Le mal triomphe toujours.","en":"Evil always wins.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"harm, pain, evil"},null,{"g":"always"}]},{"text":"L'amour triomphe de tout.","en":"Love conquers all.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"love"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"all"}]},{"text":"Ils étaient convaincus de leur triomphe.","en":"They felt sure of success.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"convinced, sure","l":"convaincu"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"them"},null]},{"text":"À vaincre sans péril, on triomphe sans gloire.","en":"Nothing ventured, nothing gained.","words":[{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to defeat, vanquish"},{"g":"without"},{"g":"peril, danger"},{"g":"we / one"},null,{"g":"without"},{"g":"glory"}]}]}